> Cost-[effective] buffets and elegant[ formal] dinners near Rocky Mountain National Park.
Here at The Ridg[eline] Hotel and Conference Center in Estes Park,[ catering] special events is one of our specialties. Whether you[�]�re planning a meeting, convention, corporate retreat, or wedding, The Ridg[eline] caters with innovative style and service. From cost-[effective] buffets to elegant[ formal] dinners, our award-[winning Executive Chef] and professional banquet staff provide our[ guests] with inspired, crowd-ple[asing] meals. We personally prepare custom menus based on theme, entertainment, decor, and ([most] importantly) budget.
Nothing[ satisfies] a crowd like a buffet, and at The Ridg[eline], we have buffet[ catering] options to suit every palate. Our breakfast buffets run the gamut from The Continental,[ featuring assorted] danishes, turnovers, muffins, and fresh fruit, to the[ del]uxe Big Thompson, which includes pancakes, French toast, ham steaks, and more. Lunch buffet options cover an array of cuisine from around the globe, ranging from the Orient Express to the Taste of Italy to South of the Border. And when it comes to dinner buffets, we pull out all the stops! Just to name a few, you can choose from the Southern Hospitality Buffet, featuring BBQ Ribs, Southern Friend Chicken and Cajun Potato Salad; the Land and Sea Buffet, including Prime Rib with Au Jus and Horseradish, and Honey Pecan Gr[illed] Salmon; or The Rodeo Buffet,[ showcasing] Chipotle Roasted Pork Loin and Slow-Bra[ised] BBQ Brisket. Vegetarian options are also available, as well as a variety of a la carte selections.
If the occasion calls for something more[ formal], look no further than our Pl[ated] Banquet menus. Choose from Pl[ated] Lunch options ranging from Chicken Penne Alfredo to London Broil, Se[ared] Salmon Filet to Homemade Pot Roast, Italian Chef Salad to Chicken Fried Chicken, and more. Pl[ated] Dinners take things a step further by including coffee, hot tea, fresh green garden salad, warm rolls, and a[ Chef�]�s choice dessert. Dinner entrees include Chicken Piccata, Seaf[ood] Trio Primavera, Gr[illed] NY Strip, Chicken Parmesan, Filet M[ign]on, and more!
